msgstr "O failover de VMs ainda funcionará durante o downtime do appliance"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/upgrading.rst:136
msgid ""
"The |morpheus| agent's QuorumCheckService operates autonomously. Cluster "
"quorum, heartbeat monitoring, and failover continue even if the "
"|morpheus| appliance is offline for maintenance."
msgstr "O QuorumCheckService do agente |morpheus| opera de forma autônoma. Quorum do cluster, monitoramento de heartbeat e failover continuam mesmo se o appliance |morpheus| estiver offline para manutenção."

